<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-748] Schema Import utility should be more strict for Java Names, Key/Value Class Names</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-748</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;User can put any characters in Java Names, Key/Value Class Names fields. But the utility should limit of allowed characters depending what purpose of field: generate file name, generate  java class name etc&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
