                            <comment id="14504652" author="kuaw26" created="Tue, 21 Apr 2015 09:12:53 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Added check for java identifiers on generate step.&lt;br/&gt;
Valid java identifier should start from letter, can contain letters and numbers, $, underscore. And should not be equal to any reserved key word (such as class, int, true, ...)&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Please test in ignite-748 branch.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
